\f1\fs22 Nearer the compound, the roadside crowd thickened. Elvi looked up from camp chairs as the trucks passed. A few applauded. Alexander raised a hand, then discovered they were applauding an Elvis who had climbed onto the roof of a limousine with a guitar.\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
