\f0\fs24 \cf2 <!$Scr_Ps::0><$Scr_Ps::1>
\f1\fs22 After the final checkpoint, Alexander\'92s convoy was slowed by parked military vehicles and troops on foot crowding the narrow road. As they approached the gates, Alexander called security. Two Shakti drones dropped into view and escorted the convoy fore and aft while the membrane across the inbound lane cleared and its weapons array shut down. Once the convoy had passed through, both came back online.\
\pard\pardeftab720\fi360\sl220\qj\partightenfactor0
\cf2 By the time they reached the Lysander Shakti Memorial Auditorium carpark, the aquarium attendant was requesting shade and the riggers were requesting clear access. The bus emptied.\
Eloise stood outside the Lysander like she was guarding the door. \
Alexander jumped from the truck. \'93Mother!\'94 He hailed.\
\'93Alexander.\'94 Eloise waited for Alexander to cross the carpark to her. She looked along the convoy.\
\'93I heard you had abandoned your post in Liechtenstein. I swear, Heinrich sounded like he expected to be executed.\'94\
\'93He should know, I\'92m the one that hands out executions,\'94 Alexander said, sounding miffed.\
\'93Show-business executions. Your scripts don\'92t make it real.\'94\
\'93You should try telling a Hollywood producer that,\'94 Alexander countered.\
\'93Have you noticed the UDF seem to want to pick a fight with me?\'94\
\'93The place is teeming with Elvi too. They tried to kill me with golf balls.\'94\
\'93Exactly. Try not to get caught in the crossfire, dear.\'94
